    "id": "how-to-use-analytics-on-your-links",
    "uuid": "how-to-use-analytics-on-your-links",
    "slug": "how-to-use-analytics-on-your-links",
    "title": "How to use Analytics on your Notion links?",
    "html": "<p>One of the cool features of Notions11 Pro, is to add analytics on your Notion links. By using this function, you can exactly tell how often your links were accessed and from which location.<br>In this blog we will show you exactly how you can enable analytics on your links.</p><p>The first step is to signup on Notions11 and register your free account. After you have registered your account, just log in and click on Create Link. Paste your Notion link and click on Next.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-image-card\"><img src=\"https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/2023/04/screen1.jpg\" class=\"kg-image\" alt=\"Notions11 Create Link screen with a Notion share URL pasted in\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1329\" height=\"443\" srcset=\"https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/size/w600/2023/04/screen1.jpg 600w, https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/size/w1000/2023/04/screen1.jpg 1000w, https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/2023/04/screen1.jpg 1329w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 720px) 720px\"></figure><p>Now it is important that you select the '<u>Track recipient locations</u>' before you Save your link. Optionally you can also select the '<u>Email me when accessed</u>' button, if you want to receive a notification when someone accessed your link.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-image-card\"><img src=\"https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/2023/04/screen2.jpg\" class=\"kg-image\" alt=\"Notions11 link settings with Track recipient locations and Email me when accessed options\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1400\" height=\"664\" srcset=\"https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/size/w600/2023/04/screen2.jpg 600w, https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/size/w1000/2023/04/screen2.jpg 1000w, https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/2023/04/screen2.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 720px) 720px\"></figure><p>Analytics are now enabled and active on your link. Where can you check those analytics? By clicking on Manage Links you will see a list of all the Notion links that you have shared. Clicking on the second 'Action' icon will show you the analytics for that link.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-image-card\"><img src=\"https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/2023/04/screen3.jpg\" class=\"kg-image\" alt=\"Notions11 Manage Links dashboard listing shared Notion links with action icons\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1361\" height=\"341\" srcset=\"https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/size/w600/2023/04/screen3.jpg 600w, https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/size/w1000/2023/04/screen3.jpg 1000w, https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/2023/04/screen3.jpg 1361w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 720px) 720px\"></figure><p>You will now see a list of how often your link was opened and by how many different users. Also, you will see from which locations/countries the link was accessed.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-image-card\"><img src=\"https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/2023/04/screen4.jpg\" class=\"kg-image\" alt=\"Notions11 link analytics showing open count, unique visitors and countries\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1181\" height=\"455\" srcset=\"https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/size/w600/2023/04/screen4.jpg 600w, https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/size/w1000/2023/04/screen4.jpg 1000w, https://jdtydxekoldfdysfyvyn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ghost-images/2023/04/screen4.jpg 1181w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 720px) 720px\"></figure>",
